(a) A team of 5 is to be chosen from 5 girls and 7 boys in an SS3 class. In how many ways can the team be chosen if:
(i) there is no restriction;
(ii) it must contain exactly 2 girls;
(iii) it must contain at least one girl? [7 marks]
(b) (i) How many different arrangements of the letters of the word ABAKALIKI are possible?
(ii) How many of these arrangements begin and end with the letter A? [6 marks]
